(1, 'India\'s Critical Minerals and Battery Recycling Sector', 'indias-critical-minerals-and-battery-recycling-sector', '<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">India will need to recycle $2 billion worth of batteries by 2034. Almost nobody is set up to do it.</span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; outline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: inherit !important;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: inherit !important;\"></span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; outline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: inherit !important;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: inherit !important;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">India sold 2.37 million EVs last year, up 38%. Tesla, BYD, and VinFast are all here now. This is consumer-led adoption, not a government push.</span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; outline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: inherit !important;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: inherit !important;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Over 246 GWh of battery manufacturing capacity has been announced through 2035. Every battery made today becomes recyclable waste in 7 to 10 years.</span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; outline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: inherit !important;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: inherit !important;\"></span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; outline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: inherit !important;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: inherit !important;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">The gap is massive. India will have 128 GWh of used batteries by 2030. Current formal recycling capacity is 2 GWh. Only 1% gets properly recycled today.</span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; outline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: inherit !important;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: inherit !important;\"></span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; outline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: inherit !important;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: inherit !important;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">The rules are already in place. Battery recycling is law. By next year, EV makers must use domestically recycled materials in new batteries. That creates guaranteed demand for proper recyclers.</span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; outline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: inherit !important;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: inherit !important;\"></span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; outline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: inherit !important;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: inherit !important;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">A recycling plant takes 2 to 3 years to build. Start now and you are ready when the wave hits. Wait and the positions are filled.</span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; outline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: inherit !important;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: inherit !important;\"></span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; outline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: inherit !important;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: inherit !important;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Large market. Set rules. Almost no competition. That does not last.</span></p>', NULL, 'reports/DCt5oYz8q04AUixwcDoMLQw1X2N056sRevMQgSLt.png', NULL, 0, 'India must recycle $2B in batteries by 2034 — but capacity is missing. A deep-dive report on the critical minerals and battery recycling opportunity. DevMantra.', 'https://devmantra.com/report-files/india-critical-minerals-battery-recycling-march-2026.html', 'Read More', '5 min read', 'published', '2026-03-28 04:50:00', NULL, '2026-03-28 04:50:13', '2026-04-03 04:57:08', 'India: Critical Minerals & Battery Recycling — DevMantra', 'https://devmantra.com/storage/reports/DCt5oYz8q04AUixwcDoMLQw1X2N056sRevMQgSLt.png', 'https://devmantra.com/reports/indias-critical-minerals-and-battery-recycling-sector', 0, NULL);
INSERT INTO `reports` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `edition_label`, `is_featured`, `meta_description`, `button_url`, `button_text`, `read_time`, `status`, `published_at`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `og_image`, `canonical_url`, `noindex`, `custom_head`) VALUES
(2, 'RBI M&A Financing Rules 2026 Explained: Limits, Eligibility, and Market Impact', 'rbi-ma-financing-rules-2026-explained-limits-eligibility-and-market-impact', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n4.0pt;margin-left:0cm\"><b><span style=\"font-size:26.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1A1A2E\">RBI Opens M&amp;A Financing:</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:26.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">What\r\nthe Numbers Actually Say</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-left:solid #1F4E79 1.5pt;\r\npadding:0cm 0cm 0cm 10.0pt;margin-left:10.0pt;margin-right:0cm\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.0pt;text-align:justify;border:none;\r\nmso-border-left-alt:solid #1F4E79 1.5pt;padding:0cm;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 0cm 10.0pt\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;color:#333366\">After 70 years of prohibition, Indian\r\nbanks can now fund corporate acquisitions. Here\'s a data-first breakdown of the\r\nrules, the market size, and what it means for dealmakers.</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#888888\">Effective Date:\r\nApril 1, 2026&nbsp; ·&nbsp; Framework: RBI Capital Market Exposure\r\nDirections, 2026</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240); background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">₹5L Cr</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">Estimated lending opportunity unlocked</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">70 yrs</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">Duration of the prior prohibition</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">75%</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">Max bank financing of deal value</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">20%</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">Cap on Tier-1 capital per bank</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:15.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1F4E79 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">The Rule Change, Precisely<o:p></o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">On February 13,\r\n2026, the RBI issued final Amendment Directions under its Capital Market\r\nExposure framework, effective April 1, 2026. The rules doubled the acquisition\r\nfinance cap from the initially proposed 10% to 20% of a bank\'s Tier-1 capital —\r\nafter banks collectively pushed back during the consultation period.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\">\r\n <thead>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 180pt; border-width: 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: white white rgb(170, 170, 170); background: rgb(31, 78, 121); padding: 5pt 7pt;\">\r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n   mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:white;text-transform:uppercase\">PARAMETER</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:270.0pt;border-top:none white 1.0pt;\r\n   border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n   mso-border-left-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:\r\n   solid #AAAAAA .25pt;background:#1F4E79;padding:5.0pt 7.0pt 5.0pt 7.0pt\">\r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n   mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:white;text-transform:uppercase\">FINAL\r\n   RULE (FEB 2026)</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n </thead>\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:180.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none white 1.0pt;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:\r\n  solid #CCCCCC .25pt;background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Max bank\r\n  financing per deal</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:270.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-left-alt:none white 0cm;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;\r\n  background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">75% of\r\n  acquisition value</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 180pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: non