\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 180pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Total direct\r\n  capital market exposure</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 270pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204) currentcolor; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">40% of\r\n  Tier-1 capital</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:180.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none white 1.0pt;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:\r\n  solid #CCCCCC .25pt;background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Borrower\r\n  eligibility</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:270.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-left-alt:none white 0cm;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;\r\n  background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">Min ₹500\r\n  Cr net worth, 3 yrs profitable, listed</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 180pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Max\r\n  debt-equity of acquirer</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 270pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204) currentcolor; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">3:1</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:180.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none white 1.0pt;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:\r\n  solid #CCCCCC .25pt;background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Valuation\r\n  requirement</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:270.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-left-alt:none white 0cm;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;\r\n  background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">2\r\n  independent valuations mandatory</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 180pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Scope</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 270pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204) currentcolor; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">Non-financial\r\n  entities only; PSU disinvestment allowed</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1F4E79 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\"><br></h2><h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">How Big Is India\'s M&amp;A Market Right Now?<o:p></o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">The policy arrived at a moment\r\nwhen Indian dealmaking is already accelerating sharply.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240); background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">$157.9B</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.0pt;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">Total deal value, India 2025</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><i><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;color:#888888\">Source: LSEG</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">$26B</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.0pt;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">M&amp;A value, Jan–Sep 2025</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><i><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;color:#888888\">649 transactions · EY India</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">+37%</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.0pt;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">YoY growth in M&amp;A value, 2025</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><i><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;color:#888888\">vs +10% globally</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">+66%</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.0pt;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">India deal surge vs Asia-Pacific</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><i><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;color:#888888\">APAC declined 5% same period</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:9.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">Sector-wise in 2025, industrials\r\nled with $35.4B (+221% YoY), followed by energy &amp; power at $28.9B (+190%),\r\nfinancials at $27B (+152%), and high technology at $19.9B (+100%).</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"300\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 225pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(208, 228, 240); background: rgb(244, 246, 248); padding: 6pt 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;\r\n  color:#1A1A2E\">Industrials</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1F4E79\">$35.4B&nbsp; +221% YoY</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"300\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 225pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 228, 240) rgb(208, 228, 240) rgb(208, 228, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(244, 246, 248); padding: 6pt 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;\r\n  color:#1A1A2E\">Energy &amp; Power</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1F4E79\">$28.9B&nbsp; +190% YoY</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"300\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 225pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(208, 228, 240) rgb(208, 228, 240); background: rgb(244, 246, 248); padding: 6pt 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;\r\n  color:#1A1A2E\">Financials</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1F4E79\">$27.0B&nbsp; +152% YoY</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"300\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:225.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #D0E4F0 1.0pt;border-right:solid #D0E4F0 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid #D0E4F0 .25pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid #D0E4F0 .25pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid #D0E4F0 .25pt;background:#F4F6F8;padding:6.0pt 8.0pt 6.0pt 8.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;\r\n  color:#1A1A2E\">High Technology</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1F4E79\">$19.9B&nbsp; +100% YoY</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1F4E79 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">What Was Broken Before<o:p></o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">Indian banks\r\nwere categorically banned from financing acquisitions since the 1950s. The\r\nlogic: acquisitions involve ownership transfer, not asset creation. Banks were\r\nexpected to fund capex and working capital not help one company buy another.\r\nThis created a structural gap.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"600\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 1.5pt; border-style: none none none solid; border-color: white white white rgb(31, 78, 121); background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 7pt 10pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  color:#333366\">Companies needing acquisition capital had to route deals\r\n  through NBFCs, foreign banks, or PE firms&nbsp;\r\n  all significantly more expensive than domestic bank credit. Management\r\n  buyouts (MBOs) and leveraged buyouts (LBOs) were structurally impossible for\r\n  most Indian corporates without expensive offshore structures.</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">The SBI\r\nchairman in August 2025 publicly said the Indian Banks Association would\r\nformally petition the RBI for this change — a signal of how deep the demand was\r\nwithin the system. Two months later, the RBI announced the framework.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1F4E79 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">Timeline of the Reform<o:p></o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:1.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">▸&nbsp;\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">OCT 1, 2025&nbsp; </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\ncolor:#222222\">RBI Governor Sanjay Malhotra announces enabling framework for\r\nbank M&amp;A financing in MPC statement.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:1.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">▸&nbsp;\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">OCT 24, 2025&nbsp; </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\ncolor:#222222\">Draft RBI (Commercial Banks – Capital Market Exposure)\r\nDirections released for public consultation; proposes 70% deal financing, 10%\r\nTier-1 cap.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:1.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">▸&nbsp;\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">NOV 21, 2025&nbsp; </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\ncolor:#222222\">Deadline for stakeholder comments; banks push for higher Tier-1\r\ncap.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:1.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">▸&nbsp;\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">FEB 13, 2026&nbsp; </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\ncolor:#222222\">Final Amendment Directions issued: cap raised to 20% Tier-1,\r\ndeal financing to 75%, ₹500 Cr net worth requirement added.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:1.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">▸&nbsp;\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">APR 1, 2026&nbsp; </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\ncolor:#222222\">Rules come into force. Banks begin building internal acquisition\r\nfinance policies.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n10.0pt;margin-left:0cm;border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;\r\npadding:0cm;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1F4E79 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">What It Means for PE &amp; VC Exits<o:p></o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">This is\r\narguably the highest-impact downstream effect. PE and VC firms in India have\r\nconsistently faced a structural problem: finding domestic buyers with cheap\r\nfinancing. Without bank-backed acquisition loans, buyers relied on expensive\r\nprivate credit, suppressing bid values and slowing exit timelines.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">With banks now\r\nable to finance up to 75% of a deal, a buyer acquiring a ₹1,000 Cr company\r\nneeds to bring only ₹250 Cr in equity — the rest can come from a syndicated\r\nbank facility. This directly improves deal economics for both sides and expands\r\nthe buyer pool beyond large conglomerates.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"600\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 1.5pt; border-style: none none none solid; border-color: white white white rgb(31, 78, 121); background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 7pt 10pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:#333366\">The 50+\r\n  circulars governing capital market exposure since 1986 have been consolidated\r\n  and repealed under the new framework — replacing decades of patchwork\r\n  regulation with a single unified set of directions.</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1F4E79 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">The Risk the RBI Is Managing<o:p></o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">Experts have\r\nflagged two concerns. First, asset-liability mismatch: acquisition loans tend\r\nto be long-duration (5–7 years) while bank funding is typically shorter.\r\nSecond, concentration risk if multiple large deals sour simultaneously.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">The 20% Tier-1\r\ncap, the 25% promoter contribution floor, the 3:1 debt-equity limit, and the\r\nrequirement for two independent valuations are all explicitly designed to\r\nprevent the balance-sheet stress seen in infrastructure loan cycles. The\r\nrestriction to non-financial entities and profitability requirements further\r\nnarrow the eligible pool to the more creditworthy end of the market.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n10.0pt;margin-left:0cm;border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;\r\npadding:0cm;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#888888;\r\ntext-transform:uppercase\">Sources</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;\r\ncolor:#AAAAAA\">RBI Amendment Directions (Feb 13, 2026)&nbsp; ·&nbsp; EY\r\nIndia Dealtracker Q3 2025&nbsp; ·&nbsp; LSEG Deals Intelligence 2025&nbsp; ·&nbsp;\r\nBusiness Standard&nbsp; ·&nbsp; Grant Thornton Bharat Dealtracker&nbsp; ·&nbsp;\r\nAngelOne Research&nbsp; ·&nbsp; Lexology / AZB &amp; Partners&nbsp; ·&nbsp;\r\nS&amp;R Associates</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n4.0pt;margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"color: rgb(18, 18, 18); font-family: &quot;Anthropic Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: none; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n4.0pt;margin-left:0cm\"><b><span style=\"font-size:26.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1A1A2E\"></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;\r\ncolor:#AAAAAA\"></span><o:p></o:p></p>', NULL, 'reports/oSZqndoQ2zgOs2f9f5XjIZzLBSidrIQuFF3NSSJx.png', NULL, 0, 'RBI\'s 2026 M&A financing rules end a 70-year ban. Limits, eligibility, lender exposure and market impact — decoded in this DevMantra deep-dive report.', NULL, 'Read More', '5 min read', 'published', '2026-03-01 20:01:00', NULL, '2026-04-18 19:50:53', '2026-04-19 05:32:20', 'RBI M&A Financing Rules 2026 Explained — DevMantra', 'https://devmantra.com/storage/reports/oSZqndoQ2zgOs2f9f5XjIZzLBSidrIQuFF3NSSJx.png', 'https://devmantra.com/reports/rbi-ma-financing-rules-2026-explained-limits-eligibility-and-market-impact', 0, NULL);
INSERT INTO `services` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `short_description`, `content`, `icon`, `image`, `hero_image`, `featured_image`, `meta_description`, `show_on_homepage`, `sort_order`, `status`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `og_image`, `canonical_url`, `noindex`, `custom_head`) VALUES
(1, 'Virtual CFO Services', 'virtual-cfo-services', 'Strategic financial leadership on demand — budgeting, forecasting, and cash flow management without a full-time hire.', '<p>At Dev Mantra, our Virtual CFO services provide your business with strategic financial leadership without the overhead of a full-time CFO. Our experienced professionals work closely with your team to deliver comprehensive financial management.</p><h3>What We Offer</h3><ul><li>Monthly Financial Reporting & Analysis</li><li>Budgeting & Forecasting</li><li>Cash Flow Management & Optimization</li><li>Financial Strategy & Planning</li><li>Investor Relations & Fundraising Support</li><li>Board Reporting & Governance</li></ul><h3>Why Choose a Virtual CFO?</h3><p>Growing businesses need strategic financial guidance but may not require or afford a full-time CFO. Our Virtual CFO service bridges this gap, providing C-suite financial expertise on a flexible, scalable basis.</p>', 'fa-solid fa-chart-line', 'services/XpKZS9iV1n5399qdVigoPKzgE4vKqOv5BgaNGa6Y.jpg', 'services/yWjaERnfJutVfMDlC1lapvZXj6qYwVWxg4dNAc4a.jpg', 'services/T3h1QpnBZ37FYT17C7pkwNmxHHMybHGpu2RDdA3o.jpg', 'On-demand Virtual CFO services for Indian SMEs, startups, and mid-market companies. Strategic finance, cash flow, fundraising and MIS — without a full-time CFO.', 1, 6, 'published', NULL, '2026-03-01 23:10:54', '2026-03-17 23:49:20', 'Virtual CFO Services in India for SMEs — DevMantra', 'https://devmantra.com/storage/services/T3h1QpnBZ37FYT17C7pkwNmxHHMybHGpu2RDdA3o.jpg', 'https://devmantra.com/services/virtual-cfo-services', 0, '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Service\",\n    \"name\": \"Virtual CFO Services\",\n    \"description\": \"Strategic financial leadership on demand — budgeting, forecasting, and cash flow management without a full-time hire.\",\n    \"url\": \"https://devmantra.com/services/virtual-cfo-services\",\n    \"image\": \"https://devmantra.com/storage/services/T3h1QpnBZ37FYT17C7pkwNmxHHMybHGpu2RDdA3o.jpg\",\n    \"provider\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Dev Mantra Financial Services\",\n        \"url\": \"https://devmantra.com\",\n        \"logo\": {\n            \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n            \"url\": \"https://devmantra.com/assets/img/logo/logo-black.png\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"areaServed\": \"Worldwide\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n    \"itemListElement\": [\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n            \"position\": 1,\n            \"name\": \"Home\",\n            \"item\": \"https://devmantra.com/\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n            \"position\": 2,\n            \"name\": \"Services\",\n            \"item\": \"https://devmantra.com/services\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n            \"position\": 3,\n            \"name\": \"Virtual CFO Services\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n</script>'),
(2, 'Finance Accounts Compliance Outsourcing Services', 'finance-accounts-compliance-outsourcing-services', 'End-to-end outsourcing for bookkeeping, accounts payable/receivable, and regulatory compliance across jurisdictions.', '<p>At Dev Mantra, we use state-of-the-art accounting software and proven methodologies to deliver effortless bookkeeping and accounting services. Our team ensures your financial records are accurate, compliant, and up-to-date.</p><h3>Core Services</h3><ul><li>Accounts and BookKeeping — Voucher Entry, General Ledger Adjustments, MIS Preparation</li><li>Payroll Accounting — Salary Processing, PF/ESI Compliance, TDS on Salary</li><li>Tax Planning & Strategy — Direct and Indirect Tax Planning</li><li>International Taxation — Transfer Pricing, DTAA Advisory</li><li>Regulatory & Compliance Advisory — GST, Companies Act, SEBI Compliance</li></ul>', 'fa-solid fa-book', 'services/zK1cIpJrGAgF3axW4nl4YSo5TOTAkRY4tTknvHfJ.webp', 'services/qoB8rEmsdbIIt9FilcojZnEa34ypBDekohsmD9Rl.webp', 'services/vTOsuGUuYKZKbK6vvrZhBHgH3nTfuQgDdomXRnlr.webp', 'End-to-end finance, accounts & compliance outsourcing — bookkeeping, AP/AR, GST, TDS, MIS & statutory filings. Built for Indian and foreign-owned firms.', 1, 7, 'published', NULL, '2026-03-01 23:10:54', '2026-03-17 23:49:53', 'Finance & Accounts Outsourcing in India — DevMantra', 'https://devmantra.com/storage/services/vTOsuGUuYKZKbK6vvrZhBHgH3nTfuQgDdomXRnlr.webp', 'https://devmantra.com/services/finance-accounts-compliance-outsourcing-services', 0, '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Service\",\n    \"name\": \"Finance Accounts Compliance Outsourcing Services\",\n    \"description\": \"End-to-end outsourcing for bookkeeping, accounts payable/receivable, and regulatory compliance across jurisdictions.\",\n    \"url\": \"https://devmantra.com/services/finance-accounts-compliance-outsourcing-services\",\n    \"image\": \"https://devmantra.com/stora