(3, 'Deals, Due Diligence & Transaction Advisory', 'deals-due-diligence-transaction-advisory', 'Thorough financial, legal, and operational due diligence to ensure informed investment and acquisition decisions.', '<p>Our Deals and Due Diligence team provides comprehensive transaction advisory services that help you make informed decisions. Whether you\'re acquiring a business, merging operations, or divesting assets, we deliver the insights you need.</p><h3>Our Approach</h3><ul><li>Financial Due Diligence — Quality of earnings, working capital analysis</li><li>Tax Due Diligence — Tax exposure assessment, compliance review</li><li>Legal Due Diligence — Contract review, regulatory compliance</li><li>Operational Due Diligence — Process evaluation, synergy assessment</li><li>Valuation Services — Business valuation, fairness opinions</li></ul>', 'fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-chart', 'services/YJ5u6TGrQ6QUdF6MSZ0QkbBYFz7vuIf5q7etvmnB.jpg', 'services/9KJVR7WG3Jj05o0YeRTBLyloEBMakxZsSIDPdtHK.jpg', 'services/10SJOY8iMm4B1pflyaQ1cC8N3vYuRiMnlScwpu62.jpg', 'Financial, tax, and operational due diligence for M&A, PE, and strategic deals in India. Sharp diligence reports that hold up under scrutiny. By DevMantra.', 1, 2, 'published', NULL, '2026-03-01 23:10:54', '2026-03-17 23:49:37', 'Due Diligence & Transaction Advisory Services — DevMantra', 'https://devmantra.com/storage/services/10SJOY8iMm4B1pflyaQ1cC8N3vYuRiMnlScwpu62.jpg', 'https://devmantra.com/services/deals-due-diligence-transaction-advisory', 0, '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Service\",\n    \"name\": \"Deals, Due Diligence & Transaction Advisory\",\n    \"description\": \"Thorough financial, legal, and operational due diligence to ensure informed investment and acquisition decisions.\",\n    \"url\": \"https://devmantra.com/services/deals-due-diligence-transaction-advisory\",\n    \"image\": \"https://devmantra.com/storage/services/10SJOY8iMm4B1pfl