(14, 'popup_points', 'India has one of the most complex, multi-layered compliance environments in the world.\r\nMost foreign companies underestimate the regulatory burden and get caught mid-expansion.\r\nDev Mantra has helped 50+ businesses set up, structure, and scale in India — compliantly.\r\nOne call. No commitment. Real answers to your India questions.', '2026-03-05 00:55:24', '2026-03-05 01:08:34'),
